--bound 10
^\[main\.p0\] .*: REFUTED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
The violation of p0 in the state with cnt == 3 is reported with --bound 3
and --bound 4. The state with cnt == 5 has no consistent value for the
nets of the loop, and with a bound of 5 or more, BMC requires the path to
reach the bound, which no path does, and reports p0 as proved.
